      "choice": "All price conditions (1.5 ATR pullback, 2.5 ATR take-profit, 1.5 ATR stop, EMA relation) are evaluated on the daily close; orders fill at the next bar's open per backtrader mechanics.",
      "reason": "The EMA exit is explicitly close-based ('closes below EMA'); using close for every condition keeps the D1 logic consistent and deterministic."
